#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:4
#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:21
msgid "Backend Settings"
msgstr "Configuración del backend"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:13
#: console/templates/console/partials/settings_tabs.html:10
msgid "Backend"
msgstr "Backend"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:22
msgid ""
"Connect the services Town Hall relies on: machine translation, email, task "
"lists and AI apps. Values saved here take priority over server environment "
"variables."
msgstr ""
"Conecta los servicios de los que depende Town Hall: traducción automática, "
"correo, listas de tareas y aplicaciones de IA. Los valores guardados aquí "
"tienen prioridad sobre las variables de entorno del servidor."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:32
#: console/templates/console/partials/quiz_questions.html:62
#: console/templates/console/partials/translated_fields.html:19
msgid "Auto-translate"
msgstr "Traducción automática"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:33
msgid ""
"Used by the Auto-translate button in every editor. Configure any of these; "
"the first one that's set and working is used."
msgstr ""
"Lo usa el botón Traducción automática de todos los editores. Configura "
"cualquiera de estos; se usa el primero que esté configurado y funcione."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:35
msgid "Self-hosted LibreTranslate"
msgstr "LibreTranslate autoalojado"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:35
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Recomendado"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:40
msgid ""
"LIBRETRANSLATE_URL is set on the server and is used while this is empty."
msgstr ""
"LIBRETRANSLATE_URL está configurada en el servidor y se usa mientras esto "
"esté vacío."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:42
msgid "How to run LibreTranslate"
msgstr "Cómo ejecutar LibreTranslate"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:43
msgid "On any machine with Docker (about 2 GB of RAM for four languages):"
msgstr "En cualquier equipo con Docker (unos 2 GB de RAM para cuatro idiomas):"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:46
msgid ""
"Then enter its address above, e.g. http://your-server:5000. Keep it on a "
"private network."
msgstr ""
"Luego escribe su dirección arriba, p. ej. http://your-server:5000. Mantenlo "
"en una red privada."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:49
msgid "API keys"
msgstr "Claves de API"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:55
msgid "Free fallback"
msgstr "Alternativa gratuita"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:60
msgid "Test language"
msgstr "Idioma de prueba"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:67
msgid "Test translation"
msgstr "Probar traducción"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:70
msgid "Uses the saved settings. Save first if you changed something."
msgstr "Usa la configuración guardada. Guarda primero si cambiaste algo."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:76
msgid "Email server (listmonk)"
msgstr "Servidor de correo (listmonk)"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:77
msgid ""
"Point Town Hall at your listmonk server. Which emails are sent, and with "
"which templates, is set in Communication &gt; Email. Without a server, emails"
" are printed in the server console instead (useful for testing)."
msgstr ""
"Conecta Town Hall con tu servidor de listmonk. Qué correos se envían, y con "
"qué plantillas, se configura en Comunicación &gt; Correo. Sin servidor, los "
"correos se muestran en la consola del servidor (útil para hacer pruebas)."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:84
msgid "LISTMONK_URL is set on the server and is used while this is empty."
msgstr ""
"LISTMONK_URL está configurada en el servidor y se usa mientras esto esté "
"vacío."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:86
msgid "How to connect listmonk"
msgstr "Cómo conectar listmonk"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:87
msgid ""
"In listmonk, open Admin > Users, create an API user with a role that can "
"manage subscribers, lists, templates and campaigns and send transactional "
"messages, and paste its name and token above."
msgstr ""
"En listmonk, abre Admin > Users, crea un usuario de API con un rol que pueda "
"gestionar suscriptores, listas, plantillas y campañas y enviar mensajes "
"transaccionales, y pega arriba su nombre y su token."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:88
msgid ""
"Delivery (SMTP, Amazon SES, Postmark...) is configured in listmonk under "
"Settings > SMTP."
msgstr ""
"El envío (SMTP, Amazon SES, Postmark...) se configura en listmonk, en "
"Settings > SMTP."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:93
msgid "Send test email"
msgstr "Enviar correo de prueba"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:95
msgid "your account email"
msgstr "el correo de tu cuenta"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:95
#, python-format
msgid "Sends to %(email)s using the saved settings."
msgstr "Se envía a %(email)s con la configuración guardada."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:100
msgid "Tasks (Bell Tower)"
msgstr "Tareas (Bell Tower)"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:101
msgid ""
"Bell Tower keeps your organization's shared task lists. Once connected, every"
" event gets a Tasks tab with a planning list and lists for the day, which "
"people can work through on their phones, pager devices or AI agents."
msgstr ""
"Bell Tower guarda las listas de tareas compartidas de tu organización. Una "
"vez conectado, cada evento tiene una pestaña Tareas con una lista de "
"planificación y listas para el día, que las personas pueden ir completando "
"desde sus teléfonos, buscapersonas o agentes de IA."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:107
#, python-format
msgid "Acting as %(user)s &middot; connected %(when)s"
msgstr "Actuando como %(user)s &middot; conectado %(when)s"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:115
#, python-format
msgid "%(linked)s of %(total)s people linked to Bell Tower"
msgstr "%(linked)s de %(total)s personas vinculadas a Bell Tower"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:116
msgid ""
"Each person is matched to the Bell Tower account with their email, or one is "
"created for them. They open their tasks from Town Hall without a Bell Tower "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Cada persona se vincula con la cuenta de Bell Tower de su correo, o se le "
"crea una. Abren sus tareas desde Town Hall sin contraseña de Bell Tower."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:119
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(user)s isn't Bell Tower staff, so Town Hall can't link people's accounts or"
" add volunteers to role lists. Make it staff in Bell Tower's admin, then link"
" accounts."
msgstr ""
"%(user)s no es personal de Bell Tower, así que Town Hall no puede vincular "
"las cuentas de las personas ni añadir voluntarios a las listas de los "
"puestos. Hazlo personal en la administración de Bell Tower y luego vincula "
"las cuentas."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:124
#: console/templates/console/event_tasks.html:33
msgid "Open Bell Tower"
msgstr "Abrir Bell Tower"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:125
msgid "Link accounts now"
msgstr "Vincular cuentas ahora"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:126
msgid "Reconnect"
msgstr "Volver a conectar"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:128
msgid ""
"Disconnect Bell Tower? Event task lists stay in Bell Tower but won't show "
"here until you reconnect."
msgstr ""
"¿Desconectar Bell Tower? Las listas de tareas de los eventos se quedan en "
"Bell Tower, pero no se mostrarán aquí hasta que vuelvas a conectar."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:129
#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:170
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Desconectar"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:133
#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:232
msgid "Connect to Bell Tower"
msgstr "Conectar con Bell Tower"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:138
msgid "Claude connector (MCP)"
msgstr "Conector de Claude (MCP)"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:139
msgid ""
"Let an AI app such as Claude help you plan events: create and edit events, "
"add roles and shifts, build task lists, set up role templates and write "
"training quizzes. It works as the staff member who connects it, can't delete "
"anything, and only reads people's profiles."
msgstr ""
"Deja que una aplicación de IA como Claude te ayude a planificar eventos: "
"crear y editar eventos, añadir puestos y turnos, crear listas de tareas, "
"configurar plantillas de puestos y escribir cuestionarios de formación. Actúa"
" como el miembro del personal que lo conecta, no puede eliminar nada y solo "
"lee los perfiles de las personas."

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:141
msgid "Connector URL"
msgstr "URL del conector"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:150
msgid "How to connect Claude"
msgstr "Cómo conectar Claude"

#: console/templates/console/backend_settings.html:152
msgid "In Claude, open Settings > Connectors and choose Add custom connector."
